      "reasoning": "I need to evaluate my hand. I have two Forests, an Island, and four spells: Ormos, Archive Keeper (a 5/5 flyer for {6UU}), Somberwald Stag ({3}{G}{G}), Sylvan Brushstrider ({2}{G}), and Tome Anima ({3}{U}). \n\
