\n\
Yes — it triggers when I cast my second creature spell each turn.\n\
\n\
So if I cast Trufflesnout (first), then Somberwald Stag (second), Tome Anima gains flash, haste, and trample — could attack for 3 or 4 with trample.\n\
\n\
That’s a potential plan.\n\
\n\
But first, I survive this turn.\n\
\n\
