\n\
I completely missed that. I thought it was tapped, but it’s not — it entered this turn, but only has summoning sickness from previous turn? No.\n\
\n\
I played it on **turn 4**, during my precombat main.\n\
\n\
Now it’s my **opponent’s** combat phase — turn 4.\n\
\n\
