      "reasoning": "Thriving Grove has two abilities that trigger on entry:\n\
1. Enters tapped\n\
2. Choose a color other than green\n\
\n\
I must choose the order.\n\
\n\
I want to **choose a color** first, so I know what mana it can produce for future turns.\n\
\n\
So I select: **Thriving Grove: As Thriving Grove enters, choose a color other than green.**\n\
\n\
I'll choose **Red** — my opponent is in R/G, so they might overextend into burn, and I can cast red cards later if needed.\n\
\n\
Or **White** for potential protection.\n\
\n\
