\n\
Synergy.\n\
\n\
Now, I have:\n\
- 5 untapped lands: 3 Forest, Island, Thriving Grove (can tap for {G} or {U})\n\
- One land drop remaining\n\
\n\
Best play:\n\
1. **Play a land** — I must, to cast **Ormos** this turn\n\
2. I have 5 lands, need 6 for Ormos ({4}{G}{U})\n\
\n\
So I **play a land**.\n\
\n\
Hand has no land — I can’t.\n\
\n\
I don’t have a land in hand.\n\
\n\
So I **cannot play a land** — stuck at 5.\n\
\n\
Then I **cannot cast Ormos**.\n\
\n\
Disaster.\n\
\n\
I can cast:\n\
- **Dawntreader Elk** ({1}{G})\n\
- **Oneirophage** ({3}{U})\n\
- **Tome Anima** ({3}{U})\n\
- **Somberwald Stag** ({3}{G}{G}) — but I only have 5 lands, spending 5 — possible\n\
\n\
But without Ormos, I can’t stabilize.\n\
\n\
Worst case.\n\
\n\
I must survive.\n\
\n\
Best plays:\n\
- Cast **Oneirophage** — flying, synergizes with Larcenist\n\
- Then **Tome Anima** — set up for flash\n\
- But not enough mana\n\
\n\
Mana: {5}{G}{U} total? I have 5 lands, all untapped.\n\
\n\
Assume I can produce: {3}{G}{G}{U}\n\
\n\
Spells:\n\
- **Oneirophage** {3}{U} — pay 4\n\
- **Tome Anima** {3}{U} — same\n\
- **Dawntreader Elk** {1}{G} — cheaper\n\
- **Somberwald Stag** {3}{G}{G} = {5} — I have exactly that\n\
\n\
I can cast **Somberwald Stag** — a 5/5 for {5}\n\
\n\
Or **Oneirophage** — 1/2 flying, grows\n\
\n\
But I need pressure and resilience.\n\
\n\
Since I can’t cast Ormos, I must attack.\n\
\n\
Next turn, opponent likely kills me.\n\
\n\
But if I cast **Somberwald Stag**, I can attack — 5 damage.\n\
\n\
With **Library Larcenist**, when it attacks, I draw — helps refill.\n\
\n\
Then **Oneirophage** gets a +1/+1.\n\
\n\
But I don’t have enough mana for both.\n\
\n\
Priority: cast **Oneirophage** — flying threat, synergy.\n\
\n\
Then pass, attack next turn.\n\
\n\
But **Somberwald Stag** is bigger.\n\
\n\
I think I must cast **Oneirophage** — it’s a finisher with the synergy.\n\
\n\
So:\n\
- I cannot play a land — no land in hand\n\
- Cast **Oneirophage** for {3}{U}\n\
\n\
Then next turn, hope to draw land and cast Ormos.\n\
\n\
But I'm at 4 life — I may not get the chance.\n\
\n\
I cast **Oneirophage**.\n\
\n\
